<title>USA: Transaction Network CFO to leave company.</title>
<headline>Transaction Network CFO to leave company.</headline>
<dateline>RESTON, Va. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transaction Network Services Inc said on Monday its chief financial officer Brian Barnum would leave the company soon to become the CFO of a private Internet related company.</p>
<p>A search was underway for a successor, the company said.</p>
<p>Transaction Network provides data communications services for transaction-oriented applications.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
